      "before": "",
      "after": "4…          Kc5       5.Lf8         Kd6       6.Lc8\n\n6…           b4 6…Txc8? 7.e8D+.\n\nSterker dan 1…Kc4.\nOf 1…Pxb7 2.Lxd5+ Kb4 3.Lxb7\nTe8 4. Lg7 Zie dezelfde stand als\nzet 4. in de hoofdvariant.\n\nEn nu de fijne zet:\n\nmet de dreiging 4…Txe7? 5.Lf8.\nNiet goed  is hjer 4.Lf6? wegens\n\nremise.\n\nZodat 6...Txe7? verliest na 7.Lg4\nb4 8.Kg5 b3 9.Kf6 b2 10.Lxe7+.\n\nEn wit wint.\n\n“In this study our Belgian friend\nIgnace Vandecasteele shows how\nblack cannot stop the dangerous\nwhite pawns in such a way that he\ncan also save the draw.”  is het\ncommentaar van ‘editor’ Ed van de\nGevel.",
      "beforeVariant": {}
    }
